# Extra secrets for the Edge Functions. Copy to supabase/functions/.env and
# `pnpm functions:secrets` uploads them to the project.
#
# SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEYS and SUPABASE_SECRET_KEYS are injected
# automatically on the hosted platform — do not set them here (the CLI rejects
# names starting with SUPABASE_).
#
# Example:
# HAL_API_TOKEN=
